sometimes combobox cannot be filled, what's wrong with my codes? fred_tomke i meant lines like this (princ "
... read blocks ...
) (setq *all_block_names (f:sub_get_all_block_names)) (princ "
... clear combo ...
) (dcl-combobox-clear transfoa1/form/cborblistnew) (princ "
... fill combo ...
) (dcl-combobox-addlist transfoa1/form/cborblistnew *all_block_names) please note, that the blocks-collection also contains modelspace, paperspaces, xrefs, dimensions (beginning with *d). regards, fred fred
